  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1411.05 Department Inspection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1411.05 Department Inspection.\n\n(a) Agents of the commissioner shall be subject to the standards set forth in the “ANSI/ACCT 03-2019 CHALLENGE COURSES AND CANOPY/ZIP LINE TOURS STANDARDS” (Revision of ANSI/ACCT 03-2016 Standards) or the ASTM International standards listed in Saf-C 1402.01(a), available as noted in Appendix B.\n\n(b) In addition to (a) above, agents of the commissioner shall be granted free access to any challenge course or zip line pursuant to Saf-C 1405.05 and shall be authorized to conduct inspections at any reasonable time, with or without prior notice.\n\nSource. #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #13666, eff 6-20-23; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nAPPENDIX B\n\nRule | Material Incorporated | How Material May be Obtained\n\nSaf-C 1402.01(a); Saf-C 1402.01(b)(2), Saf-C 1402.01(d)(1);Saf-C 1402.04(a); Saf-C 1402.09; Saf-C 1403.01(b); Saf-C 1403.02(d); Saf-C 1404.01(d); Saf-C 1405.02(d); Saf-C 1405.08(c)(3); Saf-C 1411.01(a), (b) and (c); Saf-C 1411.04(b); Saf-C 1411.05(a) | ASTM International F24 Standards Relating to Amusement Rides and Devices: F 747-21a “Standard Terminology Relating to Amusement Rides and Devices” (Oct 2021) F 770-21a “Standard Practice for Ownership, Operation Maintenance, and Inspection of Amusement Rides and Devices” (Oct 2021) F 1159-16E01 “Standard Practice for Design of Amusement Rides and Devices that are Outside the Purview of other F24 Design Standards” (Jan 2017) F 1193-18a “Standard Practice for Quality, Manufacture, and Construction of Amusement Rides and Devices” (Dec 2018) F 1957-99 “Standard Test Method for Composite Foam Hardness-Durometer Hardness” (Feb 2017) F 2007-18 “Standard Practice for Design, Manufacture, and Operation of Concession Go-Karts and Facilities” (Dec 2018) F 2137-19 “Standard Practice for Measuring the Dynamic Characteristics of Amusement Rides and Devices” (Nov 2019) F 2291-21 “Standard Practice for Design of Amusement Rides and Devices” (Jun 2021) F 2374-21a “Standard Practice for Design, Manufacture, Operation and Maintenance of Inflatable Amusement Devices” (Jul 2021) F 2375-09 “Standard Practice for Design, Manufacture, Installation and Testing of Climbing Nets and Netting/Mesh used in Amusement Rides, Devices, Play Areas and Attractions” (Jul 2017) F 2376-21a “Standard Practice for Classification, Design, Manufacture, Construction, and Operation of Water Slide Systems” (Oct 2021) F 2460-19 “Standard Practice for Special Requirements for Bumper Boats” (Nov 2019) F 2959-21 “Standard Practice for Aerial Adventure Courses” (Jun 2021) F 2960-16 “Standard Practice for Permanent Amusement Railway Ride Tracks and Related Devices” (Nov 2016) F 2970-20 “Standard Practice for Design, Manufacture, Installation, Operation, Maintenance, Inspection and Major Modification of Trampoline Courts” (Feb 2020) F 2974-20 “Standard Practice for Auditing Amusement Rides and Devices” (Feb 2020) F 3054-18 “Standard Practice for Operations of Amusement Railway Rides, Devices, and Facilities” (Apr 2018) F 3133-21 “Standard Practice for Classification, Design, Manufacture, Construction, Maintenance, and Operation of Stationary Wave Systems” (Jun 2021) F 3158-21 “Standard Practice for Patron Transportation Conveyors Used with a Water Related Amusement Ride or Device” (Jun 2021) F 3214-18 “Standard Practice for Characterization of Fire Properties of Materials Specified for Vehicles Associated with Amusement Rides and Devices” (Mar 2018). | ASTM International PO Box C700 West Conshohocken, PA 19428-2959 Telephone: 877-909-2786 Website: https://www.astm.org $57.00, PDF format $50.00, PDF format $50.00, PDF format, other formats available $63.00, PDF format $57.00, PDF format, other formats available $57.00, PDF format, other formats available $57.00, PDF format, other formats available $114.00, PDF format $82.00, PDF format $63.00, PDF format, other formats available $63.00, PDF format, other formats available $50.00, PDF format, other formats available $82.00, PDF format $82.00, PDF format, other formats available $98.00, PDF format $50.00, PDF format $50.00, PDF format, other formats available $57.00, PDF format, other formats available $68.00, PDF format $50.00, PDF format, other formats available\n\nSaf-C 1402.01(b)(1); Saf-C 1403.01(b); Saf-C 1403.02(d); Saf-C 1404.01(d); Saf-C 1405.02(d); Saf-C 1411.01(a), (b) and (c); Saf-C 1411.04(b); Saf-C 1411.05(a) | “ANSI/ACCT 03-2019 CHALLENGE COURSES AND CANOPY / ZIP LINE TOURS STANDARDS” (Revision of ANSI/ACCT 03-2016 Standards) | Association for Challenge Course Technology (ACCT) P.O. Box 19797 Boulder, CO 80308 Telephone Orders: (303) 827-2432 Website: https://www.acctinfo.org Cost: $120.00 + S/H hardcopy $95.00 digital on-line copy",
